{"id":"c340cdb497b145d0881cd5554f032d2d","model":"gpt-oss-120b","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\n  \"answer\": \"Teen Titans Go!\",\n  \"citations\": [\n    [\"Tara Strong filmography\", 1],\n    [\"List of Teen Titans Go! episodes\", 1]\n  ]\n}","reasoning_content":"We need to answer: \"Which of Tara Strong major voice role in animated series is an American animated television series based on the DC Comics fictional superhero team, the 'Teen Titans'?\" So we need to identify which of her major voice roles (list includes \"Rugrats\", \"The Powerpuff Girls\", \"The Fairly OddParents\", \"Drawn Together\", \"Teen Titans\" and the spin-off series \"Teen Titans Go!\") corresponds to the description: \"an American animated television series based on the DC Comics fictional superhero team, the 'Teen Titans'.\" That description matches \"Teen Titans\" (the 2003 series) or \"Teen Titans Go!\"? The description from evidence: In List of Teen Titans Go! episodes, it says: \"\\\"Teen Titans Go!\\\" is an American animated television series based on the DC Comics fictional superhero team, the \\\"Teen Titans\\\".\" So that description matches \"Teen Titans Go!\" not the original \"Teen Titans\". The question: \"Which of Tara Strong major voice role in animated series is an American animated television series based on the DC Comics fictional superhero team, the \\\"Teen Titans\\\"?\" So among her major voice roles, the one that is an American animated TV series based on the DC Comics team is \"Teen Titans Go!\" (as per evidence). So answer: \"Teen Titans Go!\" Provide citation: need to cite evidence that Tara Strong major voice role includes \"Teen Titans Go!\" and that \"Teen Titans Go!\" is an American animated series based on DC Comics team. We have two pieces:\n\n- From Tara Strong filmography: sentence 1 includes \"Teen Titans\" and the spin-off series \"Teen Titans Go!\" (the text: \"Many of her major voice roles include animated series such as ... \\\"Teen Titans\\\" and the spin-off series \\\"Teen Titans Go!\\\"\").\n\n- From List of Teen Titans Go! episodes: sentence 1 says \"\\\"Teen Titans Go!\\\" is an American animated television series based on the DC Comics fictional superhero team, the \\\"Teen Titans\\\".\"\n\nThus answer: \"Teen Titans Go!\" Provide citations: [ \"Tara Strong filmography\", 1 ] and [ \"List of Teen Titans Go! episodes\", 1 ].\n\nReturn JSON."},"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":716,"completion_tokens":506,"total_tokens":1222,"audio_prompt_tokens":0},"created":1791989440,"object":"chat.completion","prompt_filter_results":null}